WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.520
Tired of spending hours making land

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.502
cover maps across ArcGIS and QGIS?

3
00:00:06.502 --> 00:00:07.642
Meet LULCkit.

4
00:00:07.892 --> 00:00:11.508
Drop any GeoTIFF directly into Browser GeoTIFF Studio.

5
00:00:11.508 --> 00:00:13.984
Your raster stays one hundred percent

6
00:00:13.984 --> 00:00:15.524
private on your device.

7
00:00:15.774 --> 00:00:17.908
Built for both desktop and mobile,

8
00:00:17.908 --> 00:00:19.603
so you can inspect rasters,

9
00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:20.607
switch palettes,

10
00:00:20.607 --> 00:00:21.862
and export anywhere.

11
00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:24.720
Here is what is packed inside LULCkit.

12
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.704
Auto-classify Sentinel-2 and RGB imagery,

13
00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:31.472
compute NDVI and NDWI indices,

14
00:00:31.472 --> 00:00:34.887
and render publication A4 print maps.

15
00:00:35.137 --> 00:00:39.202
Turn raw unstyled satellite GeoTIFFs into cartographic

16
00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:43.117
A4 maps and interactive MapLibre viewers in seconds.

17
00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:45.867
Run offline from the Python CLI,

18
00:00:45.867 --> 00:00:50.397
or launch free cloud GPU inference on Hugging Face Spaces,

19
00:00:50.397 --> 00:00:53.130
with exact geodesic area analytics.

20
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:57.071
Over five hundred thousand hectares mapped in seconds,

21
00:00:57.071 --> 00:00:58.917
across three open runtimes,

22
00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:00.626
with zero server uploads.

23
00:01:00.876 --> 00:01:03.228
LULCkit is free and open source.

24
00:01:03.228 --> 00:01:07.199
Try it right now in your browser or star it on GitHub.
